// trades away "the cafeteria is always fully visible from any corner"
// (its half-diagonal is ~12.8 tiles, slightly more than this radius now)
// in favor of fog actually being visible at screen edges during normal
// gameplay, which was specifically requested.
const VISION_RADIUS_TILES = 9; // [BUG FIX] Scaled down to match the new VIEW_TILES=17 zoom level (was 10 for VIEW_TILES=18)
// During a power sabotage, vision shrinks to barely more than your own feet —
